# Select an environment from http-client.env.json in Rider's "Run with" menu.
# A value named apiToken in http-client.private.env.json overrides this OS variable.
@apiToken = {{$env.OFFICEDAYS_API_TOKEN}}

# Status uses the requirement effective in the selected month.
# DaysPerWeek mode converts to an equivalent percentage (days * 20).
# Required office days round up: ceil(eligible working days * percentage / 100).
### Current user's current-month status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Selected-month status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status?year=2026&month=9
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Accept: application/json

